/Title (As a group of visitors is guided down into the basement, the lightssuddenly go completely dark. Mass panic ensues. Visitors stampede and crush one anothertrying to escape. A supernatural force attacks the people trapped in the basement. Mac, who is outside, tries to help, but the situation spiraledcompletely out of control. Paul, Joey, Alex, and numerous visitors die during the event. Sara is reported to be the sole surviving crew member.)
